WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:26.880
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.560 --> 01:35.840
Who's so bold

01:35.920 --> 01:37.560
to dare deceive Master Yan?

01:45.400 --> 01:46.360
You.

01:48.760 --> 01:51.880
Me? Master Yan, you must be joking.

01:53.040 --> 01:56.120
I obtained a batch of fine jade
from Master Zhou,

01:56.200 --> 01:58.880
thinking it was foolproof,
but unexpectedly,

01:59.680 --> 02:01.120
it turned out to be fake jade.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.960
He told me this jade
came from the Yue family

02:04.040 --> 02:06.280
and if I wanted compensation,
I should come to you.

02:06.800 --> 02:07.840
He was also deceived by you.

02:07.920 --> 02:11.200
Nonsense! He knew perfectly well…

02:11.760 --> 02:12.960
Knew what?

02:16.800 --> 02:19.440
In any case, this receipt from Master Zhou

02:19.520 --> 02:21.600
clearly states it's from the Yue family.

02:22.120 --> 02:23.960
So, you need to compensate me.

02:26.520 --> 02:27.960
I have no money.

02:28.040 --> 02:29.800
If you're broke, then I'll have no choice
but to report you.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.960
-You…
-Oh, right!

02:32.040 --> 02:33.600
In that dowry you gave me,

02:33.680 --> 02:35.040
there were also several boxes of jade.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.720
I honestly can't tell
if they're real or fake.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.800
How about we send them all
to the Prefect's Office?

02:39.400 --> 02:40.640
But who knows

02:40.720 --> 02:43.400
if the governor
will trust his own young master

02:43.480 --> 02:46.480
or stand for your Yue family's justice?

02:46.560 --> 02:49.000
If this ruins your family's reputation,

02:49.080 --> 02:51.960
you'll have no place left in Shaozhou.

02:52.040 --> 02:53.080
Yan Zijing,

02:53.160 --> 02:55.160
I have no past grievances
nor recent enmity with you.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.640
Why are you scheming against me?

02:56.720 --> 02:59.240
Clearly, you made the fake jade.
Why accuse me of scheming against you?

03:02.440 --> 03:03.840
Master Yan,

03:03.920 --> 03:05.480
whatever the case,

03:05.560 --> 03:08.960
we'll be family soon, won't we?

03:09.040 --> 03:11.720
Aren't you going to marry Yunxiu?

03:11.800 --> 03:13.640
As for the price,

03:14.400 --> 03:15.240
we can negotiate.

03:30.760 --> 03:31.640
Master!

03:39.600 --> 03:41.240
-Did you find the back door?
-Yes, it's over there.

03:41.320 --> 03:42.840
-Let's go, quickly!
-Duanwu.

03:44.400 --> 03:46.960
I just saw the Master
bring a lot of men to the Yue residence.

03:52.440 --> 03:55.520
Loud, find a safe place
to settle Lady Shiqi

03:55.600 --> 03:57.120
and find the best doctor
in Shaozhou to treat her hand.

03:59.440 --> 04:00.360
Let's go.

04:04.120 --> 04:06.240
Don't be afraid.
They'll take good care of you.

04:07.200 --> 04:08.680
I'll handle things with your father.

04:09.480 --> 04:10.520
Go now.

04:10.600 --> 04:11.880
-Let's go.
-Duanwu…

04:11.960 --> 04:13.120
Let's go, Shrimp.

04:13.200 --> 04:14.240
Go, quickly!

04:16.360 --> 04:17.480
Take good care of her!

04:22.400 --> 04:23.320
I…

04:24.080 --> 04:26.440
I can give you Yunxiu.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.160
No payment needed.

04:29.440 --> 04:31.120
She's my blood sister,

04:31.720 --> 04:33.000
and it's not your place to offer her.

04:43.400 --> 04:44.760
Master Yan.

04:44.840 --> 04:45.760
Master Yan…

04:46.600 --> 04:49.720
Please, have mercy on me! Master Yan…

04:49.800 --> 04:51.040
I ask you.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.800
How did Yue Yunxiu come to the Yue family?

04:53.880 --> 04:56.400
How is she your blood sister?

04:56.480 --> 04:59.000
She's my elder brother's
illegitimate daughter.

04:59.840 --> 05:00.800
Your elder brother?

05:01.320 --> 05:02.280
Yes.

05:02.800 --> 05:04.680
After my elder brother died,

05:04.760 --> 05:09.360
his mistress brought Shiqi to Shaozhou,
seeking my protection.

05:09.440 --> 05:11.360
Later, I saw she had a talent
for carving jade,

05:11.440 --> 05:13.920
so I kept her by my side.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.920
Where did that jade pendant come from?

05:17.720 --> 05:19.440
The jade pendant… I picked it up.

05:19.520 --> 05:21.080
Back then,

05:21.160 --> 05:24.760
I thought it was quite interesting.

05:27.840 --> 05:28.920
Quite interesting?

05:37.000 --> 05:37.960
Then,

05:39.400 --> 05:40.720
where is the girl with the jade pendant?

05:45.400 --> 05:47.560
I'm asking you.
Where is the girl with the jade pendant?

05:53.280 --> 05:55.280
She… She's dead.

06:18.440 --> 06:19.600
How did she die?

06:21.680 --> 06:22.880
I'm asking you. How did she die?

06:22.960 --> 06:25.400
She fell from a horse.

06:26.800 --> 06:29.760
Cui Ding had me guard
outside the Yan family villa,

06:30.560 --> 06:31.600
but then,

06:32.120 --> 06:34.680
her nanny took her and ran.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.960
So, I chased after them…
chased after them…

06:51.120 --> 06:52.560
-And then?
-Master,

06:52.640 --> 06:54.720
let's not ask anymore. Let's not ask.

06:55.600 --> 06:58.400
-I'm asking you. What happened next?
-She… She…

06:58.480 --> 07:01.360
Then she fell from the horse

07:01.960 --> 07:03.400
and died.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.800
He told me

07:34.880 --> 07:36.080
my sister is dead.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.560
Do you believe him?

07:38.640 --> 07:40.080
Master.

07:49.560 --> 07:50.800
-Master!
-Master!

07:50.880 --> 07:52.600
Spare me!

07:52.680 --> 07:53.520
Move aside.

07:54.560 --> 07:56.320
-Move aside!
-Master!

08:02.160 --> 08:03.120
Master!

08:05.240 --> 08:06.800
Master!

08:10.080 --> 08:11.320
Stop him!

08:14.160 --> 08:15.200
Master!

08:16.520 --> 08:17.360
Master!

08:17.880 --> 08:18.800
Master!

08:20.560 --> 08:21.920
Master, don't kill him!

08:22.000 --> 08:23.240
Calm down! Master!

08:24.320 --> 08:26.040
Do you all believe him?

09:08.720 --> 09:11.080
I don't know much
about the Yan family in Yangzhou.

09:11.160 --> 09:12.320
Do you know, Master?

09:12.400 --> 09:13.840
The entire Yan family in Yangzhou

09:14.680 --> 09:16.000
has been completely wiped out.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.360
Not a single one survived.

09:28.240 --> 09:30.240
I made this for my sister.
Is it beautiful?

09:30.320 --> 09:31.280
Yes.

09:33.400 --> 09:35.840
The two of them make a pair.
Do you like it, my dear sister?

09:36.480 --> 09:39.440
Look, your brother treats you so well.

09:40.040 --> 09:41.560
Here, Zijing.

09:41.640 --> 09:42.880
Let me put this on you too.

10:13.000 --> 10:15.600
Why does everyone
want to destroy the Cui family?

10:18.480 --> 10:19.760
Master Shijiu,

10:19.840 --> 10:21.400
when we return,

10:21.480 --> 10:22.880
how should we explain this
to the family head?

10:24.920 --> 10:25.960
Return?

10:27.680 --> 10:28.720
We can't go back.

10:28.800 --> 10:31.240
We should just go back to Yangzhou,
Master Shijiu.

10:31.800 --> 10:33.240
The family head won't blame us.

10:33.320 --> 10:35.640
But I can't forgive myself,

10:37.640 --> 10:39.120
nor can I face Father.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.480
Then where can we go?

10:45.400 --> 10:46.440
Wuling.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.080
Wuling?

10:48.840 --> 10:49.680
Master Shijiu,

10:50.280 --> 10:51.840
we can't go to Wuling.

10:51.920 --> 10:52.920
Master Eight of Wuling once fought

10:53.000 --> 10:55.000
for the family head position
with our head.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.680
If we go without warning,

10:56.760 --> 10:59.840
he will definitely try to harm us…

11:01.720 --> 11:03.720
Wuling has always been
our Cui family's asset.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.080
Now that our family is in trouble,

11:05.680 --> 11:07.120
he must lend a hand.

11:07.640 --> 11:10.200
As long as there's a sliver
of hope for our family,

11:11.880 --> 11:13.360
what's there to fear in death?

11:14.440 --> 11:15.440
Oh…

11:22.800 --> 11:23.720
Stop drinking.

11:24.720 --> 11:25.920
You can't keep drinking like this.

11:28.200 --> 11:29.640
It's fine. Come on.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.760
I told you, I'm fine.

11:32.840 --> 11:35.520
What about your health?
What if your old illness returns?

11:36.520 --> 11:39.160
-Don't worry about me.
-Stop drinking!

11:40.680 --> 11:41.680
I'll drink with him.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.720
They say

12:09.160 --> 12:10.680
this is the best wine in Shaozhou.

12:10.760 --> 12:11.680
Let me pour you a taste.

12:52.360 --> 12:53.760
If you can't drink, then don't.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.640
If it makes you feel better, drink.

13:13.160 --> 13:14.960
When I escaped from the pearl farm,

13:16.720 --> 13:18.200
I realized Lady Eight was my mother.

13:19.680 --> 13:21.160
The moment she died before me…

13:24.280 --> 13:26.000
Perhaps that's exactly how you feel now.

13:27.880 --> 13:29.280
Whether she's with us or not,

13:30.560 --> 13:31.800
I know she'd hope

13:32.800 --> 13:33.880
that I live well.

13:43.280 --> 13:46.040
So, your mother, your father, and sister

13:48.200 --> 13:49.680
would wish the same.

13:57.280 --> 13:58.240
Right.

14:03.600 --> 14:04.480
Here.

14:11.880 --> 14:18.120
SHAOZHOU INN

14:18.200 --> 14:19.280
I have a younger sister.

14:20.520 --> 14:21.920
She's my adoptive parents' child.

14:23.160 --> 14:24.040
I don't know where she is now

14:25.440 --> 14:27.200
or if she's doing well.

14:28.680 --> 14:31.600
I have a sister too. I remember back then,

14:32.880 --> 14:34.120
she was so very small

14:34.200 --> 14:36.560
and her cheeks always rosy.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.080
She was always smiling at me

14:40.040 --> 14:41.960
and always nagging me to take her out.

14:47.280 --> 14:48.800
I feel sorry for you.

14:48.880 --> 14:50.200
What's there to feel sorry about?

14:52.200 --> 14:53.880
What was the pearl farm like before?

14:54.400 --> 14:55.520
Back then,

14:56.040 --> 14:57.960
though pearl diving was tough,

14:58.640 --> 15:00.280
it was voluntary
for those able and willing.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.680
And my father was so kind back then.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.800
He never forced anyone.

15:06.480 --> 15:07.440
So, later,

15:08.440 --> 15:10.800
our whole family
went to the Western Regions for trade,

15:11.360 --> 15:13.120
and we gained a foothold in Yangzhou.

15:15.120 --> 15:15.960
That's wonderful.

15:21.960 --> 15:24.160
They say we all live in darkness.

15:28.320 --> 15:29.280
But look.

15:32.080 --> 15:33.640
If you look up, there's light.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.720
You're such a kind soul!

16:35.800 --> 16:36.960
Thank you!

16:37.040 --> 16:39.920
-Please, have mercy.
-I have no money.

16:40.760 --> 16:42.120
Please, pity us.

16:43.600 --> 16:44.840
Thank you!

16:47.360 --> 16:48.560
It's terrifying!

16:48.640 --> 16:49.480
Give us some food.

16:49.560 --> 16:50.560
-Get lost!
-Please, give us some food.

16:50.640 --> 16:51.480
A bit of food, please.

16:52.760 --> 16:54.120
Thank you!

16:55.080 --> 16:57.600
Isn't Wuling known for its Wuling stones?

16:57.680 --> 16:59.240
Each piece is worth a fortune.

16:59.320 --> 17:01.160
Why are the townsfolk here
living in such misery?

17:01.240 --> 17:02.560
Is Master Eight truly wealthy?

17:02.640 --> 17:05.280
The price of Wuling stones
has never gone down.

17:05.359 --> 17:07.280
How could Master Eight not have money?

17:07.359 --> 17:09.040
He hasn't become the family head

17:09.119 --> 17:10.920
because he's too selfish.

17:12.040 --> 17:14.040
I just didn't expect him to be so selfish.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.480
Show some mercy. Two hundred mace.

17:15.560 --> 17:16.680
-Get lost!
-Two hundred mace and take her away!

17:16.760 --> 17:18.040
-Get lost!
-Master,

17:18.119 --> 17:19.000
please, take her with you.

17:19.079 --> 17:20.079
-I'm hungry…
-Please, Master!

17:20.160 --> 17:21.880
-I'm starving…
-I beg you.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.480
Thank you, Master!

17:28.560 --> 17:31.040
-Thank you, Master!
-Thank you, Master!

17:31.120 --> 17:32.480
-Thank you!
-Thank you, Master!

17:32.560 --> 17:34.600
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

17:34.680 --> 17:36.120
-Thank you!
-Here…

17:38.040 --> 17:39.920
Take it and go home.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.760
Hurry. Thank the Master.

17:43.840 --> 17:44.760
Dear, thank the Master.

17:44.840 --> 17:46.200
-Thank you!
-Thank you, Master!

17:46.280 --> 17:47.960
-Thank you
-Now, get going!

17:50.960 --> 17:53.960
Prepare some herbal brews
to guard against miasma.

17:54.040 --> 17:55.000
We all need to drink it.

17:55.080 --> 17:56.280
Also,

17:56.360 --> 17:58.080
get some lantana flowers ready.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.040
Yes, sir.

18:34.280 --> 18:36.280
My apologies, my dear niece,

18:36.360 --> 18:38.360
for making you wait so long.

18:38.960 --> 18:40.040
I heard you were here,

18:40.120 --> 18:42.200
so I spurred my horse,

18:42.280 --> 18:44.640
rushing back from the mines.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.680
Greetings, Master Eight.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.320
Shijiu, no need for formalities.

18:53.400 --> 18:56.280
What guidance do you have
for us this time?

18:57.080 --> 18:58.200
I can't offer guidance.

18:58.800 --> 19:00.920
I've come with a message from my father.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.320
My father is gravely ill,

19:03.400 --> 19:05.440
and the Cui family elders
have sent me here

19:05.520 --> 19:07.080
to request your return to Yangzhou.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.760
The Cui family elders?

19:11.560 --> 19:13.560
Since when did they remember me?

19:15.120 --> 19:16.680
Shijiu, you should know

19:16.760 --> 19:18.720
I am a disgraced man,

19:18.800 --> 19:19.920
banished to Wuling in defeat.

19:23.160 --> 19:25.640
But ever since I was a child,
my father would tell me

19:26.160 --> 19:28.120
how you and he overcame

19:28.200 --> 19:30.280
the poisonous miasma here in Wuling,

19:30.360 --> 19:32.280
how you built
the mines and stone quarries,

19:32.360 --> 19:33.680
and how, using Wuling stone,

19:33.760 --> 19:35.240
you opened the stone-carving market.

19:35.320 --> 19:37.200
You followed him through thick and thin,

19:37.280 --> 19:38.600
expanding territories,

19:38.680 --> 19:40.720
even at the cost of your own health.

19:41.320 --> 19:42.240
All these years,

19:42.760 --> 19:43.920
he's only ever

19:44.560 --> 19:46.000
spoken well of you.

19:50.240 --> 19:53.880
You truly have a silver tongue.

19:55.680 --> 19:56.960
If he remembered me so fondly,

19:57.040 --> 19:59.040
then why, after all these years,

19:59.120 --> 20:01.160
has he never set foot in Wuling

20:01.240 --> 20:04.320
or called me back
to the ancestral home in Yangzhou?

20:10.360 --> 20:12.840
Back then, when you fought
for the family head position,

20:12.920 --> 20:14.840
it caused quite a stir,

20:14.920 --> 20:18.080
and the Cui family elders held a grudge.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.680
My father felt he wronged you

20:20.760 --> 20:23.040
and has spent all these years
trying to mediate.

20:23.560 --> 20:25.600
So, this time,
taking advantage of his illness,

20:25.680 --> 20:27.040
he persuaded the elders

20:27.120 --> 20:30.080
and specifically sent me
to bring you back.

20:31.840 --> 20:32.680
Truly?

20:32.760 --> 20:34.040
I wouldn't dare lie to you.

20:34.120 --> 20:35.120
It's the absolute truth!

20:36.600 --> 20:37.520
Very well.

20:38.800 --> 20:40.440
Then I shall arrange a banquet

20:40.520 --> 20:43.440
to welcome you.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.200
During the feast,

20:47.280 --> 20:50.440
I will inform the stewards
of the family head's directive.

20:51.400 --> 20:52.560
Please rest assured.

20:57.720 --> 20:58.640
Master,

20:59.480 --> 21:01.400
the family head
truly is in poor health this time.

21:03.520 --> 21:04.440
It seems

21:05.320 --> 21:06.160
she hasn't lied to me.

21:06.760 --> 21:08.560
But I still find Lady Shijiu's visit

21:08.640 --> 21:09.880
rather suspicious.

21:09.960 --> 21:11.200
Perhaps we should place her
under house arrest first.

21:11.960 --> 21:12.880
No rush.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.920
Let her bring out

21:16.720 --> 21:18.680
the family head's token at the banquet,

21:18.760 --> 21:20.440
and we'll act after that.

21:20.520 --> 21:22.280
A young woman

21:22.360 --> 21:24.200
can't stir up much trouble.

21:24.880 --> 21:25.720
Understood.

21:40.760 --> 21:42.080
Master Shijiu,

21:42.160 --> 21:44.040
this place looks like a den of bandits.

21:44.120 --> 21:46.360
Every guard has a fierce look

21:46.440 --> 21:47.680
and carries such a long blade.

21:47.760 --> 21:49.840
We'd better leave quickly.

21:49.920 --> 21:53.200
Besides, we don't actually
have the family head's decree.

21:54.080 --> 21:55.440
If I say we do, then we do.

21:55.520 --> 21:57.440
-But…
-No "but".

21:58.680 --> 22:00.160
If we don't see each of the stewards,

22:00.680 --> 22:02.880
how can we reclaim control over Wuling?

22:03.600 --> 22:06.240
Wuling has long been
out of the Cui family's hands.

22:06.320 --> 22:07.360
With Master Eight here,

22:07.440 --> 22:08.680
I fear

22:09.480 --> 22:11.120
those stewards won't listen to us.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.680
Then we'll make him disappear.

22:15.320 --> 22:16.640
Where are the items
I asked you to prepare?

22:18.160 --> 22:19.360
They're all ready.

22:21.640 --> 22:22.600
Good.

22:52.600 --> 22:55.320
Now tell me everything you've done

22:56.520 --> 22:57.880
and everything you know.

22:59.680 --> 23:02.600
The Cui family commissioned me

23:03.200 --> 23:04.760
to make a replica of the Apsaras statue.

23:04.840 --> 23:07.160
They promised that once it was done,

23:07.240 --> 23:09.800
I'd get to keep the original,

23:09.880 --> 23:11.840
and they even offered me

23:11.920 --> 23:14.960
ten taels of pearls annually
as hush money.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.120
I…

23:16.200 --> 23:18.600
I really didn't know
that the Apsaras statue

23:18.680 --> 23:20.880
was a tribute gift to the court.

23:20.960 --> 23:24.080
Otherwise,
no matter how much you threaten me,

23:24.160 --> 23:26.640
I wouldn't have dared to forge it!

23:26.720 --> 23:29.120
You said the Cui and Yue families
have no connection,

23:30.080 --> 23:30.920
so how did he find you?

23:31.800 --> 23:32.720
Just by chance.

23:45.200 --> 23:47.880
I'll talk. I'll talk.

23:48.520 --> 23:52.840
It was Master Eight
who introduced me to the Cui family.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.640
That's all…

24:15.520 --> 24:16.560
Speak!

24:17.440 --> 24:19.120
It was…

24:19.200 --> 24:20.960
It was Black Dragon Bandits.

24:21.480 --> 24:24.000
They were the intermediaries.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.760
Black Dragon Bandits?

24:28.520 --> 24:30.120
If Master Eight was so powerful,

24:30.200 --> 24:31.040
why would he stay hidden in Wuling?

24:32.320 --> 24:36.960
He's been helping the Cui family
trade along the Western route

24:38.160 --> 24:41.760
and incidentally helping me get goods.

24:42.360 --> 24:46.280
He thought that this would
give him control over the Cui family,

24:46.360 --> 24:47.640
but in the end,

24:48.720 --> 24:51.840
he still couldn't beat Cui Jingchu,

24:51.920 --> 24:54.840
so he retreated to Wuling.

24:57.320 --> 24:58.200
Then…

25:02.520 --> 25:04.080
There's been a complaint

25:04.160 --> 25:05.080
against the Yue family
for selling fake jade,

25:05.160 --> 25:07.400
and I am here by order to investigate!

25:08.160 --> 25:09.200
Search!

25:18.040 --> 25:20.960
Mr. Zhang, you truly are an upright man

25:21.040 --> 25:22.080
with a keen eye for detail.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.120
You've come at just the right time.

25:26.000 --> 25:26.920
The Yue family

25:27.920 --> 25:29.160
also deceived me of my money.

25:29.840 --> 25:30.840
How will they compensate me?

25:31.520 --> 25:33.440
After we liquidate
the Yue family's assets,

25:35.280 --> 25:36.520
all claimants will be compensated.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.600
But with so many victims,

25:40.720 --> 25:41.960
can one Yue family really afford it?

25:46.920 --> 25:48.000
However, I have an idea.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.120
I've heard

25:53.160 --> 25:54.720
that you're an old friend of Master Eight.

25:55.960 --> 25:57.120
I wonder

25:57.200 --> 25:58.200
if he'd be willing to help you.

26:19.440 --> 26:20.360
Lady Shiqi.

26:20.880 --> 26:21.880
Duanwu!

26:21.960 --> 26:23.800
-What's wrong?
-Duanwu, I've waited for you for so long.

26:23.880 --> 26:26.280
I heard my father
was involved in jade forgery.

26:27.040 --> 26:29.120
Is there hope for him and the Yue family?

26:30.320 --> 26:31.880
-Don't worry.
-Is there?

26:36.720 --> 26:37.760
No.

26:41.680 --> 26:44.760
I… I also heard

26:46.040 --> 26:47.120
that my hand issue…

26:49.400 --> 26:50.880
was caused by my father.

26:55.680 --> 26:56.680
Why…

26:58.720 --> 27:00.920
Why would he do this to me?

27:03.160 --> 27:04.440
He took me in as his daughter,

27:04.520 --> 27:05.680
treated me as his own.

27:06.280 --> 27:07.840
Why would he do this to me?

27:08.560 --> 27:11.960
-What did I do wrong to deserve this?
-You did nothing wrong.

27:12.480 --> 27:14.080
None of this is your fault.

27:23.240 --> 27:25.680
I always thought,
despite my unfortunate origins,

27:25.760 --> 27:27.200
that I have found someone

27:28.000 --> 27:29.320
who understood me,

27:30.000 --> 27:31.160
who taught me to carve jade,

27:31.880 --> 27:33.480
who passed on his skills.

27:33.560 --> 27:37.800
He said he's the light on my path,
shaping me into jade.

27:37.880 --> 27:39.720
He also said I was his finest work.

27:42.080 --> 27:44.840
But I never imagined

27:44.920 --> 27:47.800
he would destroy me
to achieve his own success.

27:53.080 --> 27:54.000
Yes,

27:54.680 --> 27:56.960
I was always an unwanted,

27:58.320 --> 27:59.440
unloved orphan.

28:00.320 --> 28:01.480
You are not an orphan

28:02.600 --> 28:04.160
nor anyone's "work".

28:05.520 --> 28:06.680
You are Yue Yunxiu,

28:08.280 --> 28:09.560
the Jade Goddess of Shaozhou.

28:12.080 --> 28:13.120
No, I'm not.

28:14.080 --> 28:16.520
My hands are ruined,
and I can't do anything now.

28:17.400 --> 28:19.160
I'm nothing but a useless wreck.

28:21.320 --> 28:22.320
The doctor said,

28:22.400 --> 28:23.600
if you take care of them properly,

28:24.720 --> 28:26.080
there's a chance of recovery.

28:28.080 --> 28:28.960
Believe me.

28:30.640 --> 28:31.680
Duanwu.

28:44.720 --> 28:46.080
Yu Shi's Apsaras statue?

28:46.840 --> 28:47.800
The original?

28:48.560 --> 28:49.400
Yes.

28:57.080 --> 28:58.360
Give me the blood-stained pearl.

28:59.640 --> 29:00.800
The blood-stained pearl.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.440
There were originally two of them.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.720
Where is the other one?

29:33.240 --> 29:34.600
It could be lost in the desert,

29:35.640 --> 29:37.080
or maybe someone else has it.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.280
I don't know.

29:41.160 --> 29:42.200
The blood-stained pearl…

29:43.040 --> 29:43.880
The Apsaras statue…

29:47.480 --> 29:48.640
What does all this mean?

29:51.960 --> 29:53.120
Haven't you figured it out?

29:58.920 --> 30:00.120
Yu Shi was my father?

30:03.400 --> 30:04.520
Yu Shi is in the Western Regions,

30:04.600 --> 30:06.600
so I can find him there,

30:06.680 --> 30:07.560
right?

30:14.440 --> 30:15.400
Your father's…

30:18.880 --> 30:20.120
already dead.

30:44.120 --> 30:45.480
It was related to the Apsaras statue?

30:47.120 --> 30:48.120
Yes.

30:50.960 --> 30:52.640
And also to the Cui and Yue families?

30:53.400 --> 30:55.200
-Yes.
-And the Yan family of Yangzhou.

31:03.000 --> 31:03.840
Yes.

31:06.600 --> 31:07.480
What happened?

31:07.560 --> 31:08.920
At this point,

31:09.880 --> 31:11.200
why carry this burden?

31:14.120 --> 31:15.760
I just want to know.

31:27.600 --> 31:28.720
Yu Shi

31:29.240 --> 31:31.160
was the chief jade carver
of the Yan family in Yangzhou.

31:31.960 --> 31:33.040
Lady Eight

31:33.840 --> 31:35.160
was originally Lady Yan of the Liu family,

31:36.680 --> 31:37.840
the matriarch of the Yan family,

31:39.040 --> 31:40.920
and my mother's personal maid.

31:41.000 --> 31:42.880
They grew up together as friends.

31:45.680 --> 31:46.680
Your father died

31:48.240 --> 31:49.920
because of the Yan family.

31:59.560 --> 32:00.600
Have you avenged all your grudges?

32:05.400 --> 32:07.440
The Cui and Yue families
are merely merchants.

32:10.160 --> 32:11.360
Escorting tribute gifts

32:12.160 --> 32:13.360
is a critical task.

32:16.000 --> 32:17.240
How could a few merchants
accomplish it alone?

32:17.920 --> 32:18.920
There were others,

32:21.160 --> 32:22.000
weren't there?

32:25.160 --> 32:26.480
You don't have to tell me.

32:29.720 --> 32:30.920
I can investigate on my own.

32:43.480 --> 32:44.560
It was the Black Dragon Bandits.

32:47.040 --> 32:48.400
Black Dragon Bandits?

32:48.920 --> 32:50.520
They're desert bandits
from the Western Regions.

32:51.640 --> 32:53.160
Then why would they do this?

32:54.200 --> 32:57.640
Power, greed, human nature.

32:58.760 --> 32:59.680
These things

33:00.360 --> 33:03.080
are more vicious than the whips
you endured at the pearl farm.

33:03.160 --> 33:06.000
So, you're going to the Western Regions
to find the Black Dragon Bandits?

33:08.160 --> 33:09.000
Yes.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.720
I'll go with you.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.040
Alright.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.800
I'll take you with me.

33:28.640 --> 33:30.520
This was left by your dad.

33:30.600 --> 33:33.400
Keep it safe,
and find him in the Western Regions.

33:33.920 --> 33:36.240
Remember, find him in the Western Regions.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.880
Mom.

33:42.840 --> 33:43.840
I'm sorry.

33:44.560 --> 33:46.280
I can't find Father.

33:47.720 --> 33:49.640
I thought that once I found him,

33:49.720 --> 33:51.560
I'd no longer be alone.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.760
But in the end,
I must keep walking this path alone.

33:57.840 --> 33:58.800
Mom.

34:00.200 --> 34:02.040
Have you seen Dad?

34:03.320 --> 34:05.480
Are you both watching me from above,

34:06.440 --> 34:08.080
worried I'll never find a home?

34:20.639 --> 34:21.560
Yan Zijing,

34:23.760 --> 34:25.120
now I understand

34:27.159 --> 34:29.560
why you feel
there's nothing left to hold onto

34:30.960 --> 34:32.080
in this miserable world.

35:48.160 --> 35:49.480
He told you everything?

35:52.000 --> 35:52.960
Don't resent him.

35:54.080 --> 35:56.000
When he saw the blood-stained pearl,

35:56.600 --> 35:57.880
he recognized you right away.

36:03.880 --> 36:05.880
You only know
the cruelty of the pearl farm

36:06.840 --> 36:08.920
but not the dangers of the world.

36:12.800 --> 36:15.080
He's been protecting you in his own way.

36:16.720 --> 36:18.680
That's the only way he knows

36:19.360 --> 36:21.520
because that's how he survived.

36:27.000 --> 36:29.160
From the moment I boarded that ship,
I was prepared.

36:29.760 --> 36:30.880
I have no regrets.

36:33.960 --> 36:35.080
I don't resent him either.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.680
I'm sorry.

36:38.200 --> 36:39.640
I overthought things.

36:40.240 --> 36:41.440
Actually…

36:45.680 --> 36:46.800
I think you two are very similar.

36:48.560 --> 36:49.560
Yes.

36:53.880 --> 36:55.680
We both live only for hate,

37:00.640 --> 37:02.360
consumed by vengeance.

37:04.080 --> 37:05.160
He is,

37:06.160 --> 37:07.640
but I believe you are not.

37:22.760 --> 37:23.840
Miss Duanwu,

37:25.440 --> 37:26.320
what's wrong?

37:36.360 --> 37:37.320
Why are you here?

37:38.520 --> 37:39.640
Are your hands hurting again?

37:42.920 --> 37:44.000
I heard…

37:45.520 --> 37:47.280
you are leaving here soon.

37:49.920 --> 37:51.320
Merchants are like that,

37:52.040 --> 37:54.160
never staying in one place too long.

37:54.760 --> 37:56.760
We're preparing to leave Shaozhou.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.120
I know what you're worried about,

38:00.200 --> 38:01.880
but the Master
has arranged everything for you.

38:02.560 --> 38:04.840
He's found a good family
in Shaozhou for you.

38:04.920 --> 38:05.920
You can stay there in peace.

38:07.640 --> 38:08.960
Can I go with you?

38:10.960 --> 38:12.360
I don't want to live with strangers.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.000
But we're heading to the Western Regions.

38:23.680 --> 38:24.840
I'm not afraid.

38:25.800 --> 38:29.040
If my hands recover,
I can help you carve jade.

38:29.120 --> 38:30.640
If they don't,

38:31.800 --> 38:33.480
I can learn and do anything.

38:47.920 --> 38:48.920
Esteemed stewards,

38:50.000 --> 38:51.680
tonight's banquet

38:51.760 --> 38:54.520
is to welcome Lady Shijiu.

38:56.840 --> 38:58.160
This is her.

38:58.240 --> 39:00.720
Cui Shijiu, the direct daughter
of the Cui family head.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.800
Greetings, everyone.

39:02.400 --> 39:03.600
Honored stewards,

39:03.680 --> 39:06.840
you've all worked
alongside my father here in Wuling,

39:06.920 --> 39:09.040
giving your all for the Cui family.

39:09.120 --> 39:11.560
On behalf of my father,
I thank each of you.

39:13.000 --> 39:13.840
And, of course,

39:15.800 --> 39:18.040
my deepest gratitude goes to Master Eight.

39:18.120 --> 39:20.800
He has fought alongside my father

39:20.880 --> 39:22.760
and is the elder I respect most.

39:32.200 --> 39:34.320
This is fine wine I brought from Yangzhou.

39:35.960 --> 39:36.920
A toast to all of you.

39:47.680 --> 39:49.320
And a special toast to Master Eight.

39:49.840 --> 39:50.920
I'll drink first to show my respect.

40:02.520 --> 40:03.520
Honored stewards,

40:09.040 --> 40:10.280
I toast you all.

40:12.240 --> 40:14.200
To Master Eight!

40:30.320 --> 40:31.600
Shijiu,

40:31.680 --> 40:33.440
didn't you have a decree
from the family head

40:33.520 --> 40:35.200
to convey to the stewards?

40:37.640 --> 40:38.680
Yes.

40:43.480 --> 40:44.560
The Cui family head decrees…

40:47.040 --> 40:48.120
CUI

41:12.600 --> 41:15.600
Seeing the family head's token
is as if seeing the family head!

41:15.680 --> 41:19.000
Seeing the family head's token
is as if seeing the family head!

41:27.440 --> 41:29.040
The Cui family head decrees

41:30.800 --> 41:32.320
I am to take over Wuling.

41:36.040 --> 41:37.520
-Master Eight!
-Master Eight!

41:37.600 --> 41:38.520
-Master Eight!
-Master Eight!

41:38.600 --> 41:40.360
-Master Eight!
-Someone,

41:40.440 --> 41:42.040
help him back to his room to rest!

41:42.680 --> 41:44.600
-Go call the doctor!
-How did he collapse all of a sudden?

41:44.680 --> 41:45.800
Indeed.

41:45.880 --> 41:47.160
Be careful with him.

41:48.480 --> 41:50.440
How did he suddenly collapse?

41:55.760 --> 41:56.600
With Master Eight unwell,

41:57.280 --> 41:59.040
it's fortunate
the family head had foresight

41:59.600 --> 42:01.800
and arranged for me
to come here and manage the Wuling mines.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.640
Take over the mines?

42:06.240 --> 42:07.080
How can this be?

42:07.160 --> 42:08.800
Hasn't Master Eight
cut ties with Yangzhou?

42:08.880 --> 42:10.440
But he just acknowledged
the family head's token,

42:10.520 --> 42:11.920
so perhaps he had this planned all along.

42:12.000 --> 42:12.960
Indeed.

42:13.040 --> 42:14.440
As you all saw just now,

42:15.600 --> 42:17.880
even Master Eight
respects the family head's token.

42:18.480 --> 42:19.640
I hope each of you

42:20.440 --> 42:21.560
understands the situation.

42:21.640 --> 42:23.000
Otherwise,

42:24.280 --> 42:26.320
the Wuling mines belong to the Cui family,

42:26.400 --> 42:28.120
and the Cui family
can reclaim them at any time.

42:31.680 --> 42:34.760
The Cui family
is willing to stand with you all,

42:35.360 --> 42:37.120
but if anyone has other intentions,

42:37.200 --> 42:39.920
hand over everything
given by the Cui family and just leave.

42:40.800 --> 42:41.920
I, Cui Shijiu,

42:44.080 --> 42:45.360
will not stand in your way.

42:45.960 --> 42:46.800
What should we do?

42:46.880 --> 42:48.320
Even Master Eight
bowed to the family head's token.

42:48.400 --> 42:49.720
The Cui family
has already sent someone here.

42:53.320 --> 42:55.600
We'll follow Master Shijiu's instructions!
